### 1️⃣ Inscription utilisateur
POST http://localhost:8084/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pseudo": "bbb",
  "email": "bbb@gg.com",
  "password": "T@u123456789"
}

### 2️⃣ Login pour récupérer JWT
POST http://localhost:8084/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pseudo": "bbb",
  "password": "T@u123456789"
}

### 3️⃣ Vérification du token
GET http://localhost:8084/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJiYmIiLCJpYXQiOjE3NTY2NjcyNzgsImV4cCI6MTc1NjY3MDg3OH0.URVAFcA-I6Y-luwvCJFgNmyLTFgzTUK6OasbmGzTe0E



### 4️⃣ Modification du profil
PUT http://localhost:8084/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJiYmIiLCJpYXQiOjE3NTY2NjcyNzgsImV4cCI6MTc1NjY3MDg3OH0.URVAFcA-I6Y-luwvCJFgNmyLTFgzTUK6OasbmGzTe0E
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pseudo": "bbb-modif",
  "email": "bbb-modif@gg.com"
}

### 5️⃣ Vérification côté user-service (profil existant)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/users/search?pseudo=bbb-modif
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJiYmIiLCJpYXQiOjE3NTY2NjcyNzgsImV4cCI6MTc1NjY3MDg3OH0.URVAFcA-I6Y-luwvCJFgNmyLTFgzTUK6OasbmGzTe0E
Accept: application/json

### 6️⃣ Si profil non trouvé, tentative création via auth-service (pour test)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJiYmIiLCJpYXQiOjE3NTY2NjcyNzgsImV4cCI6MTc1NjY3MDg3OH0.URVAFcA-I6Y-luwvCJFgNmyLTFgzTUK6OasbmGzTe0E
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pseudo": "bbb-modif",
  "email": "bbb-modif@gg.com"
}

### Rechercher un utilisateur par pseudo
GET http://localhost:8082/api/users/search?pseudo=bbb-modif
Accept: application/json

